WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:02.610
- Okay, Sistine, so is this a true story?

00:00:02.610 --> 00:00:03.570
- Uh-oh.

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:06.630
- Did your father like
throw you into sharks

00:00:06.630 --> 00:00:08.280
at some point in your life?
- [Sophia] Oh, my God.

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:10.038
- See, it sounds crazy, and unfortunately-

00:00:10.038 --> 00:00:10.871
- Well, it sounds like

00:00:10.871 --> 00:00:11.704
someone should have called child services.

00:00:11.704 --> 00:00:12.600
- [Sistine] It's true.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:13.433
- But yeah.

00:00:13.433 --> 00:00:14.266
- Fair enough. It's true.

00:00:14.266 --> 00:00:16.290
It was a controlled environment
so it was very safe.

00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:17.123
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:00:17.123 --> 00:00:18.510
- Living with the Sharks experience.

00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:21.360
And my dad... I was
seriously afraid of them.

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:24.240
He thought it'd be funny to
throw some chum in my one-piece

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:25.470
and shove me right in.

00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:27.030
- And she's also a horrible swimmer.

00:00:27.030 --> 00:00:29.580
- And I'm bad swimmer, so
it was just a really...

00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:31.470
I don't think I talked to
you the rest of the trip.

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:33.090
- No, you didn't.
- I was very upset.

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:33.923
- [Kelly] Oh my God.

00:00:33.923 --> 00:00:35.460
- I wanted to see if the sharks bite.

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:37.231
- No, you did not.

00:00:37.231 --> 00:00:38.353
(Kelly and audience laughing)

00:00:38.353 --> 00:00:39.743
- I got two other daughters.

00:00:39.743 --> 00:00:41.793
- I got two other daughters. (clapping)

00:00:41.793 --> 00:00:42.626
- Thank you.

00:00:42.626 --> 00:00:43.743
- The fact that he was like-

00:00:43.743 --> 00:00:44.576
- You know what?

00:00:44.576 --> 00:00:45.600
- "I'm gonna put chum
in there," and then...

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:46.433
- [Sistine] I know.

00:00:46.433 --> 00:00:48.311
Well now I know where I
stand on the leader board.

00:00:48.311 --> 00:00:51.213
- (indistinct) Have you gotten him back?

00:00:52.290 --> 00:00:54.330
- I did something a little naughty.

00:00:54.330 --> 00:00:55.380
First season-
- [Sylvester] A little?

00:00:55.380 --> 00:00:57.600
- I pretended I was pregnant.

00:00:57.600 --> 00:00:58.710
- Can you imagine?

00:00:58.710 --> 00:00:59.670
- I did.
- On camera.

00:00:59.670 --> 00:01:02.640
- I mean on camera, so it... you know.

00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:06.360
- She made a birthday cake with
all these goofy baby parts.

00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:08.610
- No. By the way, Kelly,
it was my mom's idea.

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:09.737
So that's not me.

00:01:09.737 --> 00:01:10.644
(audience laughing)

00:01:10.644 --> 00:01:11.477
- Yeah, I like doing something.

00:01:11.477 --> 00:01:13.110
- Like baby parts, like, you know the-

00:01:13.110 --> 00:01:14.760
- I actually thought he was
gonna have a heart attack

00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:15.593
and I kept saying-

00:01:15.593 --> 00:01:16.560
- Like Freddy Krueger.

00:01:16.560 --> 00:01:18.270
- By the way, it was on his birthday.

00:01:18.270 --> 00:01:19.320
- [Kelly] Oh my gosh.

00:01:20.310 --> 00:01:23.553
I love your women so much in your family.

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:26.073
- We gotta dish it back, you know?

00:01:26.073 --> 00:01:28.620
- [Kelly] I know. You threw
her into sharks with chum.

00:01:28.620 --> 00:01:29.576
- I did.

00:01:29.576 --> 00:01:32.340
- You've gotta like... She
gets like five more things.

00:01:32.340 --> 00:01:33.527
- Thank you.

00:01:33.527 --> 00:01:34.360
- That's so horrifying.

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:35.820
- The guys kept saying,
"Oh, they don't bite."

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:37.057
I go, "It's a shark.

00:01:37.057 --> 00:01:39.300
"Maybe you have one there
that has emotional problems."

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:40.830
- By the way, we all got in the water.

00:01:40.830 --> 00:01:42.750
Guess who stayed on the boat.
- The whole time.

00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:43.583
- For sure.

00:01:43.583 --> 00:01:44.416
- He did not-

00:01:44.416 --> 00:01:45.266
- For sure?
- For sure.

00:01:45.266 --> 00:01:46.770
- He didn't put his toe in the water.

00:01:46.770 --> 00:01:48.750
We all swam with them the whole time.

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:50.760
- You can have the water,
I'm staying on the land.

00:01:50.760 --> 00:01:51.768
The shark... you know what I mean?

00:01:51.768 --> 00:01:52.863
Enough already.

